WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.654 --> 00:00:08.058
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> OK, Team B, now you have thirty seconds to ask Mike questions.

2
00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:13.164
But remember Mike can only answer Yes or No.

3
00:00:13.459 --> 00:00:18.859
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> Hello, Mike. Do you wear a uniform or special clothes?

4
00:00:18.986 --> 00:00:23.669
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Yes, I do. Not a uniform, but special clothes.

5
00:00:23.796 --> 00:00:26.591
<v><b>George:</b></v> Do you have special qualifications?

6
00:00:26.738 --> 00:00:27.783
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Yes, I do.

7
00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:30.029
<v><b>Charlie:</b></v> Do you work in a team?

8
00:00:30.103 --> 00:00:33.552
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> No. But sometimes other people help me.

9
00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:37.824
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Remember Mike, you can only answer yes or no.

10
00:00:37.887 --> 00:00:40.619
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Oh yes. Sorry.

11
00:00:41.115 --> 00:00:43.309
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> Do you work inside?

12
00:00:43.499 --> 00:00:44.796
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Yes, I do.

13
00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.800
<v><b>George:</b></v> Do you work at the weekend?

14
00:00:46.885 --> 00:00:48.171
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> No, I don’t.

15
00:00:48.477 --> 00:00:50.133
<v><b>Charlie:</b></v> Do you like your job?

16
00:00:50.323 --> 00:00:55.038
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Yes, I love it. But people don’t always like me!

17
00:00:55.650 --> 00:01:04.257
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Thank you, Mike. So, Team B, is Mike a hairdresser, a chef, or a dentist?

18
00:01:04.468 --> 00:01:06.936
You have one minute.